{"success":true,"data":{"name":"impartus","description":"CLI and terminal UI for Impartus lectures","defaultMode":"tui","flags":["--json"],"commands":[{"name":"help","usage":"impartus help"},{"name":"version","usage":"impartus version"},{"name":"courses","usage":"impartus courses"},{"name":"lectures","usage":"impartus lectures --subject \u003cid\u003e --session \u003cid\u003e"},{"name":"download","usage":"impartus download --subject \u003cid\u003e --session \u003cid\u003e [--ttid \u003cid\u003e | --start \u003cn\u003e --end \u003cn\u003e]"},{"name":"serve","usage":"impartus serve [--port \u003cport\u003e]"},{"name":"play","usage":"impartus play --subject \u003cid\u003e --session \u003cid\u003e [--lecture \u003cn\u003e] (not available in JSON mode)"},{"name":"doctor","usage":"impartus doctor"},{"name":"library","usage":"impartus library list|show|verify"},{"name":"watch","usage":"impartus watch [--subject \u003cid\u003e --session \u003cid\u003e] [--once] [--dry-run] [--events]"},{"name":"tui","usage":"impartus tui (not available in JSON mode)"}]},"error":null,"meta":{"command":"help","mode":"json"}}
